      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T21:27:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not necessarily asking for a change, but is there an advantage to the peek/lock/advance/unlock pattern here vs lock/remove/unlock? According to the comments for QUEUE_ADD_UNITS, queue_remove_unit might be faster here.",
      "revId": "c4dfbc4d982239ed3616f86fd0204b8b7ee42767",
