      "writtenOn": "2021-10-06T20:13:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to keep the items in the queue until they\u0027ve been completed, since this keeps the PD task check for pending items simple.  If we removed them, then I imagine we\u0027d need a way for the mux task to indicate it\u0027s working on a request for a port number and then the PD task would check if (queue contains no mux sets \u0026\u0026 pending port !\u003d my port), versus just if (queue contains no mux sets)",
